 "note": "Special 2v2, 12 platforms, 1 relay. Two homes per side share a middle pocket. The top home's pocket climbs over the top on a Curve_45 S-bend to the top axis platform; the bottom home's pocket dips under the centre on a Curve_45 S-bend into a T below it. The top axis platform is a remote console for the shared pockets' decks into the centre (the fastest road). Bridges: S pockets, S / M / L, Curve_45, T. Inward Last Stand keeps the console.",
